B.Um=s(["G\xf6\xe7 etmeden \xf6nce Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve ana binalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn olan en y\xfcksek seviyeye \xe7\u0131kar\u0131n; b\xf6ylece Atalar Kurgan\u0131n\u0131z \xe7ok daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc miras bonusu verir."],t.s)
