B.Rg=s(["Sa\u011fdaki sar\u0131 Kamyonet/Kervan butonuna dokunarak aktif El\xe7i Sipari\u015flerini a\xe7\u0131n.","\u0130stenen kaynaklar\u0131 ambar\u0131n\u0131zda biriktirin.",'"S\u0130PAR\u0130\u015e\u0130 TESL\u0130M ET" butonuna basarak Kut \xf6d\xfcl\xfcn\xfc ve 10 dakikal\u0131k h\u0131z takviyesini al\u0131n.'],t.s)
