B.Ur=s(["Harita \xfczerinde bir \xc7ay\u0131r karosu se\xe7in.","Etraf\u0131ndaki 6 kom\u015fu karodan en az 2'sini Orman, 1'ini Sazl\u0131k yapacak \u015fekilde fethedin.",'Merkez karoda otomatik olarak "VAH\u015e\u0130 KORULUK" rozetinin yand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcn.'],t.s)
B.U8=s(["Select a Meadow hex on the map.","Conquer neighboring tiles to place at least 2 Forests and 1 Wetland around it.",'The central tile will automatically mutate into a "WILD GLADE".'],t.s)
B.RJ=s(["Fetih yaparken rastgele yay\u0131lmak yerine Simbiyoz form\xfcllerine g\xf6re k\xfcmelenme yap\u0131n."],t.s)
B.Sn=s(["Plan your conquests to fulfill Symbiosis requirements for massive passive production boosts."],t.s)
B.Sc=s(["simbiyoz","ekoloji","hibrid","mutasyon","koruluk","vaha","gayzer"],t.s)
B.OA=new A.e7("biome_symbiosis",B.kY,"Ekolojik Simbiyoz (Hibrid Arazi Mutasyonu)","Ecological Symbiosis Engine","Kom\u015fu biyomlar\u0131n birbirini etkilemesiyle ortaya \xe7\u0131kan 4 gizli hibrid arazi mutasyonu.","4 hidden hybrid land mutations created by matching neighboring biomes.","Farkl\u0131 biyomlar yan yana fethedildi\u011finde do\u011fa rezonansa girer ve merkez karoda Simbiyoz mutasyonu olu\u015fur:\n\n1. Vah\u015fi Koruluk (Wild Glade): \xc7ay\u0131r etraf\u0131nda en az 2 Orman ve 1 Sazl\u0131k oldu\u011funda olu\u015fur. \u015eifal\u0131 polen ve +%40 ia\u015fe/odun verir.\n2. Kanyon Vahas\u0131 (Canyon Oasis): \xc7\xf6l ve Da\u011f karolar\u0131 en az 2'\u015fer kom\u015fu oldu\u011funda olu\u015fur. Tuz, baharat ve +%50 kervan alt\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar.\n3. Kristal P\u0131nar (Crystal Spring): Deniz/G\xf6l ile Da\u011f kom\u015fu oldu\u011funda a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Saf kaynak suyu ve +%40 maden h\u0131z\u0131 verir.\n4. Jeotermal Gayzer (Volcanic Geothermal): Yanarda\u011f ile Tundra/Sazl\u0131k kom\u015fu oldu\u011funda patlar. Do\u011fal buhar \u0131s\u0131s\u0131yla donmay\u0131 engeller ve +%60 h\u0131z auras\u0131 yayar.","Neighboring biomes trigger organic mutations: Wild Glade (Meadow+Forest+Wetland), Canyon Oasis (Desert+Mountain), Crystal Spring (Sea+Mountain), and Volcanic Geothermal (Volcano+Tundra).",B.PD,B.bD,"4 H\u0130BR\u0130D REZONANS",B.Wt,B.Ur,B.U8,B.RJ,B.Sn,B.Sc)
