B.RR=s(["Harita zeminine saniyede yakla\u015f\u0131k 1-2 dokunu\u015fla ritmik olarak dokunun.","\xdcst bardaki ritim \xe7ubu\u011funun ve kombo sayac\u0131n\u0131n dolmas\u0131n\u0131 izleyin.","Toy Co\u015fkusu butonu aktif oldu\u011funda basarak 10x \xfcretim patlamas\u0131n\u0131 ba\u015flat\u0131n."],t.s)
