B.QU=s(["Toy Co\u015fkusu patlamas\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131\u015f aylar\u0131nda veya b\xfcy\xfck in\u015faat y\xfckseltmelerinde kullanarak zaman kazan\u0131n."],t.s)
