B.OB=new A.e7("core_rhythm_frenzy",B.kX,"Ritmik Dokunu\u015f & Toy Co\u015fkusu","Rhythm Tap & 10x Frenzy","Bozk\u0131r davulunun ritmine uyarak haritaya dokunun. Kombo biriktirerek 10x Toy Co\u015fkusunu tetikleyin.","Tap to the rhythm of the steppe drum. Build combos to unleash 10x Toy Frenzy.",'Haritan\u0131n bo\u015f alanlar\u0131na veya karolara 0.4s - 1.2s aral\u0131klarla ritmik dokundu\u011funuzda Ritim Kombosu artar. Kombo 15 seviyesine ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda "Toy Co\u015fkusu" butonu parlar. Aktif edildi\u011finde t\xfcm binalar ve i\u015f\xe7iler 20 saniye boyunca 10 kat h\u0131zla \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.',"Tapping at steady rhythmic intervals increases your Rhythm Combo. Hitting 15 combo primes Toy Frenzy for a 20-second 10x production surge.",B.OP,B.cF,"R\u0130T\u0130M / 10X",B.WC,B.RR,B.Rj,B.QU,B.RA,B.TE)
