B.Uv=s(['K\u0131\u015f gelmeden \xf6nce G\xf6\xe7ebe yuvas\u0131na "K\u0131\u015f Ota\u011f\u0131" doktrinini takarak odun t\xfcketimini yar\u0131ya indirin.'],t.s)
B.QP=s(["Slot the Winter Tent doctrine before winter arrives to halve wood heating costs."],t.s)
